Lil Durk @lildurk’s federal murder-for-hire trial is officially underway — and things have gotten extremely serious. Lil Durk is on trial in Los Angeles over allegations that he orchestrated a revenge killing targeting rival rapper Quando Rondo. Prosecutors allege that the 2022 shooting was connected to the killing of Durk’s close friend King Von in 2020. Allegations are not findings of guilt.

What matters more here: the testimony or the evidence behind it?

